# CodeFlow — Complete Project Explanation

**CodeFlow** is a **typing practice web app for developers**. It displays real code snippets (C++, Python) and the user types them out character-by-character to improve coding speed. It tracks WPM (words per minute), accuracy, and time.

Built with **React 19 + Vite 8 + Tailwind CSS 4**.

