#### Section 5: Effects (Lines 150–171)

**Effect 1 — Live Timer:**
```jsx
useEffect(() => {
  if (isActive && startTime && !endTime) {
    timerRef.current = setInterval(() => {
      setElapsedTime(((Date.now() - startTime) / 1000).toFixed(1));
    }, 100);  // Updates every 100ms
  }
  return () => clearInterval(timerRef.current);  // Cleanup
}, [isActive, startTime, endTime]);
```

**Effect 2 — Detect Completion:**
```jsx
useEffect(() => {
  if (isComplete && !endTime) {
    setEndTime(Date.now());    // Record finish time
    setIsActive(false);         // Stop timer
  }
}, [isComplete, endTime]);
```

**Effect 3 — Auto-focus:**
```jsx
useEffect(() => {
  containerRef.current?.focus();   // Focus the code area when snippet changes
}, [snippetIndex]);
```

