#### Section 9: Character Rendering (Lines 320–360)

```jsx
const renderCodeDisplay = () => {
  return targetText.split("").map((char, index) => {
    // Determine color for each character:
    // - Already typed + had a mistake → RED with underline
    // - Already typed + no mistake → GREEN
    // - Not yet typed → GRAY (dimmed)
    // - Current cursor position → blinking blue line
    // - Current position + wrong key → RED background + shake animation
