```

Each character is individually rendered as a `<span>` with:
- Color based on status (correct/incorrect/untyped)
- A blinking cursor line at the current position
- Shake animation on wrong input
- Newlines render as `\n`, spaces as non-breaking spaces (`\u00A0`) so they're visible

