## How the App Works — Complete Flow

```mermaid
graph TD
    A["User opens app"] --> B["TypingPractice mounts"]
    B --> C["Code snippet displayed char-by-char in gray"]
    C --> D["User presses a key"]
    D --> E{"First keypress?"}
    E -- Yes --> F["Start timer"]
    E -- No --> G{"Which key?"}
    F --> G
    G -- "Correct char" --> H["Append to userInput, color GREEN"]
    G -- "Wrong char" --> I["Increment wrongAttempts, shake, show RED"]
    G -- "Backspace" --> J["Remove last char from userInput"]
    G -- "Enter" --> K["Auto-insert newline + indentation"]
    G -- "Tab" --> L["Insert up to 4 spaces"]
    H --> M{"All chars typed?"}
    I --> D
    J --> D
    K --> M
    L --> M
    M -- No --> D
    M -- Yes --> N["Stop timer, show ResultsPanel"]
    N --> O{"User choice?"}
    O -- "Retry" --> C
    O -- "Next" --> P["Load next snippet, reset"]
    P --> C
```

